body:
The useEffect hook is missing `navOverlay.isOpen` and `navOverlay.open/close` from its dependency array. This can cause stale closure issues where the effect doesn't re-run when the overlay state changes internally. Add `navOverlay.isOpen`, `navOverlay.open`, and `navOverlay.close` to the dependency array to ensure the effect properly synchronizes URL state with overlay state.
```suggestion
    }, [drawerRecordId, navOverlay.isOpen, navOverlay.open, navOverlay.close]);
```
